00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:18.220
folder, but for some reason I put it in this audio folder.

113
00:07:18.819 --> 00:07:22.100
And in Unreal Engine, what I can do is I can just move the Blueprint.

114
00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:25.540
I can drag and drop it over into the Blueprints folder and it'll

115
00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:26.740
say, do I want to move it here?

116
00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:28.259
I'm like, yeah, I want to move it here.

117
00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:32.420
Now what Unreal Engine will do is it'll leave an invisible

118
00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:38.660
Redirector behind, you can show these redirectors in your

119
00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:43.699
content browser flags, you know, the visibility flags, but essentially

120
00:07:43.699 --> 00:07:45.060
they're invisible by default.

