00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:53.759
in the Blueprints folder, it first goes to the audio folder because that

123
00:07:53.759 --> 00:07:55.480
was the original place that it was in.

124
00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:58.720
And it says, is this Blueprint in the audio folder?

125
00:07:58.759 --> 00:08:04.040
And it'll find a Redirector and it'll say, oh no, it's not in the audio folder.

126
00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:05.240
It's in the Blueprints folder now.

127
00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:08.480
And then, you know, that's an extra process that Unreal has to go through.

128
00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:10.560
So then find your Blueprint to help package it.

129
00:08:11.199 --> 00:08:17.519
That in itself would maybe work, you know, it's kind of project specific,

130
00:08:17.519 --> 00:08:18.800
but you know, that may work.

