00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:26.540
this happening on multiple different occasions.

133
00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:30.339
And this is why I say, don't just click your content folder.

134
00:08:30.339 --> 00:08:33.419
Cause it might be redirectors or redirectors, say you've put something

135
00:08:33.419 --> 00:08:37.139
in your audio folder that's moved to the character folder, that's moved to the

136
00:08:37.139 --> 00:08:38.740
Blueprints folder or something like this.

